  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "大型語言模型應用與實務",
    "sub_ename": "LARGE LANGUAGE MODEL APPLICATIONS AND PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "這門課程「大語言模型應用與實務」課程主要培養學生掌握大語言模型的部署與優化技巧。課程報含多種開源大語言模型，如 CodeLlama 和 LLaMA等，並介紹深度學習環境配置以支援模型訓練與推論。學生將學習模型優化技術，包括 GPTQ、AWQ 及 GGUF，掌握量化、效能提升與資源優化策略。透過實作應用並微調模型，以解決真實應用場景中的問題，並深入了解數據預處理、推理加速及微調技術，全面提升大語言模型的應用開發能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The \"Large Language Model Applications and Practices\" course equips students with practical skills in deploying and optimizing models like CodeLlama and LLaMA. It covers deep learning environment setup and optimization techniques such as GPTQ, AWQ, and GGUF and focuses on model quantization, performance enhancement, and resource efficiency. Students will apply these skills in hands-on projects addressing real-world scenarios, mastering data preprocessing, inference acceleration, and model tuning.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
